{"a":[20,20],"h":"<p>20.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 136.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 35.2 42.0 42.0 54.7 54.7 70.4 70.4 81.0 96.7 102.0 108.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 81.0 102.0 108.7 120.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu da Peygambere hıtabdan sonra umuma hıtabdır. Burada «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 29.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 8.2 15.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"8.2 15.0\" y=\"21.1 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » aceleyi reddir. «Hakka» ma'nâsına olduğu da söylenmiştir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 30.0 30.0 42.0 48.7 55.4 55.4 63.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 23.3 48.7 69.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Pişîn - ya'ni Dünya, zira mukabilinde 21. </p>"}